  "contentHtml": "<DIV>\r\n<DIV style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199); PADDING-LEFT: 10px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-TOP: 10px\" class=txc-textbox>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><B><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</SPAN></SPAN></B></P></DIV>\r\n<P><BR><!--StartFragment--></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">두산백과에 스테아르산의 녹는점과 어는점이 이렇게 나옵니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&lt;상온에서는 흰색의 나뭇잎 모양 결정으로</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">녹는점 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >71</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">∼</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >71.5</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">℃</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응고점 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >69.4</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">℃</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이다.&gt; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교과서에도 녹는점과 어는점이 다르다고 나오고요. 실제 실험을 해 봐도 달라요. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이유를 어떻게 설명해야 할까요? </SPAN></P></DIV>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
